How the trades were found
─────────────────────────
  Targets    Weights given by holding.
  Accounts   Brokerage account and Retirement account, rebalanced together. A
             holding above its target is sold from the accounts that hold it, in
             proportion to their holdings; one below it is bought in proportion
             to the value each account has free. Trades do not move cash between
             accounts.
  Prices     30 Oct 2026; other currencies at the exchange rates of that day.
  Trades     Whole units, each rounded towards zero. Purchases leave room for
             the fees, so the trades fit the cash each account has.
  Lots       Each account's own lot method (first in, first out unless the
             account says otherwise).
  Fees       None.
  Tax        Not estimated: no tax rates were given.
  Estimates  Volatility and expected return from the holdings' daily returns,
             Nov 2023 to Oct 2026, annualised: the Ledoit–Wolf covariance and
             historical means. Cash is riskless and earns nothing here.

